1. INTRODUCTION

ScreenBuddy is an Android application designed to provide an interactive floating pixel character experience.

The project includes application source code, interface components, character assets, custom character functionality, personality configuration, screen interaction features, and other supporting resources.

This license establishes the permissions and conditions governing the use, copying, modification, distribution, and redistribution of the software contained in this repository.

The purpose of this document is to clearly communicate the rights granted to users and developers while preserving the original copyright and license notices.

