10. PRIVACY AND DATA HANDLING

ScreenBuddy includes features that interact with the Android screen.

Depending on the user's configuration and actions, screen content may be transmitted to an external AI service for processing.

Users should understand the behavior of the application before enabling screen-related features.

Imported character images may be processed locally by the application.

This license does not replace any separate privacy policy or external service privacy agreement.

Users are responsible for ensuring that their use of the application respects the privacy and rights of other people.

